\bigg\}}_{R_1}
+\underbrace{\varepsilon^2\nabla
\big(W^{\varepsilon}\ast G+\varepsilon\phi^{\varepsilon}\ast_2\partial G\big)\nabla\psi_{\varepsilon}}_{R_2}
+\underbrace{\varepsilon^2\psi_{\varepsilon}
