G(x)=S_{\delta}(\varphi_\varepsilon F)(x) = \int_{\mathbb{R}^d}
dy\zeta_\delta(x-y)(\varphi_\varepsilon F)(y),
\qquad \zeta_\delta = \delta^{-d}\zeta(\cdot/\delta),
\end{equation*}
with $\delta = \varepsilon/4$, where $\zeta\in C_0^\infty(B(0,1/2))$
