+|\nabla\hat{\eta_{\varepsilon}}|^2\big) \\
&\lesssim\varepsilon
\|W\|^2_{L^1(0,T;L^2(Y_f))}\|G\|^2_{L^2(0,T;
L^{\infty}
(\text{supp}(\psi_{\varepsilon})))}+
\varepsilon^2\|\nabla\hat{\xi_{\varepsilon}}\|^2_{
L^2(\Omega_{\varepsilon,T})}
+\varepsilon^2\|\nabla\hat{\eta_{\varepsilon}}\|^2_{
L^2(\Omega_{\varepsilon,T})}.
